{"id":"087fd0c57545ca0b","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-least-fixed-point.md","title":"Least Fixed Point","display":"df-least-fixed-point — Least Fixed Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-least-fixed-point","aliases":["88-df-least-fixed-point"],"display":"df-least-fixed-point — Least Fixed Point","depends_on":["[[88-df-mu-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-least-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-least-fixed-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-least-fixed-point — Least Fixed Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"402228a0530457d9\" href=\"?note=402228a0530457d9\" title=\"88-df-mu-operator\">88-df-mu-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> (base set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F: \\mathcal{P}(A) \\to \\mathcal{P}(A)\">\\(F: \\mathcal{P}(A) \\to \\mathcal{P}(A)\\)</span> (monotone operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"402228a0530457d9\" href=\"?note=402228a0530457d9\" title=\"88-df-mu-operator\">88-df-mu-operator</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu F\">\\(\\mu F\\)</span> (least fixed point supplied by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"402228a0530457d9\" href=\"?note=402228a0530457d9\" title=\"88-df-mu-operator\">88-df-mu-operator</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lfp}(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{lfp}(F)\\)</span> (least-fixed-point abbreviation)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}least\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{lfp}(F)\\coloneqq\\mu F\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}least\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{lfp}(F)\\coloneqq\\mu F\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>因而<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lfp}(F)=\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq A:F(X)\\subseteq X\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{lfp}(F)=\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq A:F(X)\\subseteq X\\}\\)</span>且\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(\\mathrm{lfp}(F))=\\mathrm{lfp}(F)\">\\(F(\\mathrm{lfp}(F))=\\mathrm{lfp}(F)\\)</span>，这些性质由上游定义给出。</li>\n<li>单调算子的最小不动点是归纳定义的基础</li>\n<li>Kleene不动点定理给出了可计算情形下的构造性证明</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-mu-operator","status":"resolved","id":"402228a0530457d9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-mu-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-mu-operator","status":"resolved","id":"402228a0530457d9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F: \\mathcal{P}(A) \\to \\mathcal{P}(A)$ (monotone operator, see [[88-df-mu-operator]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-mu-operator","status":"resolved","id":"402228a0530457d9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mu F$ (least fixed point supplied by [[88-df-mu-operator]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"F: \\mathcal{P}(A) \\to \\mathcal{P}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lfp}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}least\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{lfp}(F)\\coloneqq\\mu F","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lfp